  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Compacts of Free Association, Federal Services: Federated States of Micronesia Single Audit. The Compact of Free Association was established as FSM and RMI emerged from the Trust Territory of the Pacific Islands and became sovereign states. The funding was used for general government operations, including health and education, economic development, capital improvements, and special purposes.</narrative>
